  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia's father has a car. It is morning, and they go to school. \"We are here,\" says Father. \"Get your bag, Mia.\" \"Bye, Dad!\" says Mia. \"Goodbye, Mia,\" says Father. \"See you at the end of school!\" Father smiles and waves.",
      "Mia sees her friend May. May is at the door, and she smiles. \"Hi, May!\" says Mia. \"Hello, Mia!\" says May. Leo waves from the classroom. \"Hi, Mia! Hi, May!\" says Leo. Teacher Kim comes to the door of the classroom. \"Good morning, girls!\" says Teacher Kim. \"Good morning, Teacher Kim!\" say Mia and May. Then Mia and May go in with Leo.",
      "It is the end of school. Father is at the car with a big smile. \"Hello, Mia!\" says Father. \"Hi, Dad!\" says Mia. \"How is school?\" asks Father. \"It is fun!\" says Mia. \"Bye, May!\" says Mia. \"See you!\" \"Goodbye, Mia!\" says May. Mia gets in the car, and she is very happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Mia's father takes her to school in the car, and they say bye. At school Mia says hello to her friends, and at the end of the day she says goodbye.",
